| `eval harness` | `evals/`: typed JSONL cases checked against `config/evals/eval-case.schema.json`, a closed set of deterministic scorers (`exact`, `contains`, `regex`, `json_fields`), a threshold compared as exact fractions, and a canonical per-run report checked against `config/evals/eval-report.schema.json`. Absent, failed and refused stay distinct, and zero cases is refused. | `make eval`; `make eval-live` | [`evals.case_schema`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`evals.report_schema`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`evals.threshold`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | No model judges an answer: LLM-as-judge is not built. A live answer is a candidate, never written to the dataset. | [README.md](../../evals/README.md) | always |
